  G --> H2[Supplied weighted proxy: W_h = sum of valid num_of_jobs]
  H1 --> I[Title/company distributions and ranks]
  H2 --> I
  I --> J[Weight median · quartiles · maximum · concentration]
  J --> K[Influence checks: leave-one-maximum-out and declared cap c]
  K --> L[Compare weighted and unweighted rank/order stability]
  L --> M{Source defines weight and vacancy unit?}
  M -->|No| N[Label as supplied weight proxy · never as unique openings]
  M -->|Yes| O[Still report unit and source coverage with the estimate]
  N --> P[Evidence passport · file version, denominator, parsing, scenario]
  O --> P
  P --> Q[Descriptive evidence for this dataset only]
  R[No skill field in this source] -.-> S[Do not infer skills or join titles to Analytics Jobs]
